# Auto validate and deploy (operator does not remind)

When this session **implements or fixes** control-plane or appliance code (not docs-only Q&A), finish by running checks **yourself** — never stop at “files edited”.

## Lab validation passwords (one-time operator setup)

File: **`/opt/mssp-control/.secrets/validation.env`** (gitignored, chmod 600)

Template: `deploy/environments/validation.lab.example.env`

Five passwords for demo users: `platform.admin`, `soc.manager`, `soc.analyst`, `customer.admin@demo2`, `customer.viewer@demo`.

If missing and kb011 is required: **stop and tell the operator** to create the file (do not skip kb011).

Loader: `scripts/load_validation_credentials.sh` (never print values).

## Control plane code change → always run

```bash
cd /opt/mssp-control
./scripts/production_deploy_control_plane.sh
./scripts/run_post_change_checks.sh
```

`run_post_change_checks.sh` sources validation.env and runs **kb011** when backend/frontends changed.

## Docs-only change

Skip deploy; run doc/module validator if applicable.

## Validator map

| If you touched | Run |
|----------------|-----|
| backend-api / frontends | kb011 (needs validation.env) + deploy smoke |
| Customer entitlements | kb_validate_customer_entitlement_nav.sh |
| Service catalog | kb_validate_admin_service_catalog_ops.sh |
| Appliance forwarder | kb093p_validate_appliance_critical_alert_forward.sh |
| Deploy pack | kb094_validate_production_portability_pack.sh |
| Architecture / engines / agent installers / API schemas | `python3 scripts/verify_platform_state.py` (extend the script first; `--release` before cloud cutover) |
| Admin frontend | kb018_validate_admin_frontend_foundation.sh |

## Report to operator

State: deploy ran/skipped, each validator PASS/FAIL, whether validation.env was used.

## Commit

Only when user asks. After runtime changes, still run deploy + post_change_checks.
